stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unseen
    Unseen --> Enrolled: callback / writer sid anchor then identity and session
    Unseen --> Tombstoned: logout / writer sid anchor and replay receipt
    Enrolled --> Expired: fresh writer clock reaches local absolute expiry
    Enrolled --> Tombstoned: logout / revoke anchor and sessions with receipt
    Expired --> Enrolled: verified callback / live incoming expiry and enabled principal
    Expired --> Tombstoned: logout / preserve absorbing anchor
    Tombstoned --> Tombstoned: duplicate logout / existing committed receipt
    note right of Unseen
        Derived timestamps and row existence, not a persisted status enum.
        Callback refuses expired incoming authority and disabled principals.
        Missing anchors are inserted then locked on the cell writer.
        Callback and logout serialize in either commit order.
    end note
    note right of Tombstoned
        Callback refuses this sid permanently.
        Refresh cannot dispatch or install under this binding.
        An absent sid is tombstoned before a late callback can enroll it.
    end note
